# Every text file keeps LF line ends in the working tree, on every OS: the tests compare the documentation and the
# generated code with their snippets byte for byte, and git's default on Windows (core.autocrlf) would check them
# out with CRLF. Windows batch scripts need CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
